  "conclusion": "No global winner. Fresh control passes 6/6 required Tier1 and 9/21 Tier2. Late annealing is 5/6, half G/E motion 4/6, prior smoothing .01 5/6; all 21 Tier2 cells for each are BLOCKED/unmeasured, not measured failures. Weak critic damping .05 passes 6/6 and 8/21, adding zero passes and losing the original word-hold gate. That legacy hold uses unequal acquired prefixes (control 834->4834, hybrid 1667->5667), so it is a separate original-gate cohort, not a same-clock causal comparison; other 20 Tier2 tasks match complete budgets/consumed streams and retain the same eight passes. Gaussian hybrid stationary/shift checks improve 2->15/72 and 0->3/24, but full gates fail. 77 paid attempts, 6773.287376 seconds, zero execution retries. Stop these four revisions; current selected recipe, qualifications and gates remain unchanged.",
